ped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}],"title":"OUDSSuggestionChip","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","title":"Components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}]}}}